==== Installing OpenWrt ====
The stock firmware is based on OpenWrt, you can simply upload a squashfs-sysupgrade image through the web interface.

===== Debricking =====
-> [[docs:guide-user:troubleshooting:generic.debrick]]


===== Failsafe mode =====
-> [[docs:guide-user:troubleshooting:failsafe_and_factory_reset]]

This device automatically attempts to TFTP from 192.168.1.10:/firmware_auto.bin on every boot and will flash the firmware partition with a squashfs-sysupgrade format image from that address.


